{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00157","headline":"喜雪 · 明皇帝","name":"喜雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日观卜先征，时巡顺物情。\n风行未备礼，云密遽飘霙。\n委树寒花发，萦空落絮轻。\n朝如玉已会，庭似月犹明。\n既覩肤先合，还欣尺有盈。\n登封何以报？因此谢功成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"明皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}